      "source": "Gets a new fully configured but paused <a href=\"../../web/server/WebServer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.server\"><code>WebServer</code></a> instance. Clients should\nnot be able to connect to the returned server until <a href=\"../../web/server/WebServer.html#start()\"><code>WebServer.start()</code></a> is\ncalled (which happens when the <code>ApplicationContext</code> has been fully\nrefreshed).",
